Version 2.0.0

- Renamed to `switch-netns2`.
- New usage: `switch-netns2 <name> -- <command> [args...]`. Only named namespaces (`/run/netns/<name>`) are supported.
- Mounts files from `/etc/netns/<name>/` over `/etc/` in a private mount namespace, like `ip netns exec`.
- Drops all capabilities before running the command.
- Only needs `cap_sys_admin` now. Removed the `gengetopt` dependency.
- Flat layout, no Makefile: built by `PKGBUILD` with a single `cc` call.

Version 1.0.3

- Significantly simplified and enhanced the program by removing all unnecessary code.
- Improved human-readably error reporting.
- Made `cap_sys_ptrace` capability optional.

Version 1.0.2-3

- Updated version number correctly.

Version 1.0.2

- Fixed clang-format issues.
- A bit of code refactoring.
- Typo fixes, unhappy path improvements.

Version 1.0.1

- Code cleanup.
- Updated "you can fix the problem" suggestion.
- Changelog added.

Version 1.0.0

- All features implemented
